So one time a guy came up to 'im 'n' handed 'im a box to carry to the warehouse in the back. 

'N' he did, the drunken son of a rat! 'N' the guards let 'im through! 

A few hours later the whole Rig's on alert! Turns out he raided the rigmaster's fridge, took all 'is brew 'n'... yeah, he *ate* the whole birthday shroomcake 'is wife made for 'im. Could ya believe it?&lt;end&gt;

